{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uqHs5ydm0t1793235064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>渣打集團行政總裁溫拓思指出，整體信貸周期未見轉差。而市場關注的內地和香港房地產風險，集團敞口也相當有限。</p><p></p><p>渣打集團行政總裁溫拓思表示︰「目前信貸周期仍未出現逆轉，雖然全球發生不少負面事件，本應觸發信貸周期轉差，但實際上並未出現，不論對我們或同行亦然。唯獨少數例外，特別是香港及內地房地產行業，幸好我們敞口相對較低，在香港更幾乎沒有。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.949279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.610609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:13.964669+00:00","content_hash":"2bf2f401df5a398eb457b521b65f7a86d7080e0166583d0273603a9404e49a67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.949279+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}